#. en: The prominent gray circle looks like the perfect spot<br>to install a utility pole.
msgctxt "4641:1454"
msgid "Destaca el círculo gris de su diseño.<br>Un poste eléctrico quedaría perfecto encima."
msgstr ""

#. en: Obtained through a special method, these can be<br>placed just as they are now.
